  "code": "SPQ_Q08",
  "name": "Stored Procedure Request",
  "version": "HL7 v2.5.1",
  "chapter": "Query",
  "description": "The Stored Procedure Query provides a mechanism for the querying system to invoke a stored procedure on the responding system. The request includes a stored procedure name and a list of parameters passed to it.  \n\nThe SPQ enables an application on one system to execute a stored procedure on another system, which is coded to extract specific data. \n\nSince the SPR segment includes a response format code, the response could be tabular, display or segment pattern .",
